\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {paragraph}{The wave is below the floor.}{8}{section*.20}\protected@file@percent }
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Rigorous acoustic-corruption numbers (annulus-$L^2$ vs.\ the wide truth, drift-free, phase-aware, $4\,T_{\text  {ac}}$ window). \emph  {Every} BC's wave corruption lies at or below the truth-against-itself noise floor (64\% Fourier, 14\% RMS): the radiated wave does not discriminate the BCs. The only field that separates them is the DC mean drift, where \texttt  {foextrap} and characteristic anchor ($\sim 10^{-4}$) while the finite-relaxation LODI drifts $50\times $ more.}}{9}{table.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:cvp}{{3}{9}{Rigorous acoustic-corruption numbers (annulus-$L^2$ vs.\ the wide truth, drift-free, phase-aware, $4\,T_{\text {ac}}$ window). \emph {Every} BC's wave corruption lies at or below the truth-against-itself noise floor (64\% Fourier, 14\% RMS): the radiated wave does not discriminate the BCs. The only field that separates them is the DC mean drift, where \texttt {foextrap} and characteristic anchor ($\sim 10^{-4}$) while the finite-relaxation LODI drifts $50\times $ more}{table.caption.19}{}}
